abstract: "CupidWish (https://cupidwish.com) is an interactive 360-degree WebGL 3D digital gift studio and instant flower delivery alternative. Users can create a surprise link for a birthday, girlfriend, boyfriend, or Secret Admirer by customizing a 3D forever rose in glass (or Eternal Love Tree), recording a 60-second personal voice note in the browser, and sharing it worldwide via WhatsApp link, direct email, or a printable high-resolution PNG QR code card."
